{"id":"f1638d16173e7b51","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound.md","title":"Theorem D: A Bound on Formation-Sequence Numbers","display":"thm-smullyan-sequence-bound — Theorem D: A Bound on Formation-Sequence Numbers","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound"],"display":"thm-smullyan-sequence-bound — Theorem D: A Bound on Formation-Sequence Numbers","source":"第 IV 章 pp. 53–54，Appendix Theorem D、Exercise 2（PDF 70–71）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]]","[[92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function]]","[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-sequence-bound — Theorem D: A Bound on Formation-Sequence Numbers"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 53–54，Appendix Theorem D、Exercise 2（PDF 70–71）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"495bb24d4506a7c2\" href=\"?note=495bb24d4506a7c2\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-sequence-code\">92-df-smullyan-sequence-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fffc9733e4a34483\" href=\"?note=fffc9733e4a34483\" title=\"92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function\">92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"75a1feabdeb282fb\" href=\"?note=75a1feabdeb282fb\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1\">92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq k\\leq n\">\\(1\\leq k\\leq n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_1,\\ldots,a_k\\in K_{11}\">\\(a_1,\\ldots,a_k\\in K_{11}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\\leq n\">\\(a_i\\leq n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E\\)</span> 为 # 分隔的原书编号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_{13}\">\\(\\ell_{13}\\)</span> 为规范十三进制位长；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_E:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\pi_E:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为以下定义的总函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecFn}_E^1\">\\(\\mathrm{RecFn}_E^1\\)</span> 采用原书 recursive 定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi_E(m)&amp;\\coloneqq13^{m^2+m+1}\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(a_1,\\ldots,a_k)&amp;\\leq\\pi_E(n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecFn}_E^1(\\pi_E)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi_E(m)&amp;\\coloneqq13^{m^2+m+1}\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(a_1,\\ldots,a_k)&amp;\\leq\\pi_E(n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecFn}_E^1(\\pi_E)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>设 q 为序列码。每个元素的位长≤ℓ₁₃(n)，# 的码为12且占一位，故 ℓ₁₃(q)≤kℓ₁₃(n)+k+1≤n²+n+1；最后一步用 n≥1 时 ℓ₁₃(n)≤n。自然数 q 严格小于13的自身位长次幂，因而满足上界。</p>\n<p>指数图由原书 Theorem E 为 Σ₁，多项式图为 Σ₀，合取及存在消去中间值保持 Σ₁。π 是总函数，所以前一命题给出 recursive。原书 Theorem D 的此版本只用于非空形成序列；不臆造一个未定义的空 SeqNum，也不在 n=0 时使用错误的 ℓ₁₃(0)≤0。</p>\n<p>这个极宽上界只用于把形成序列的搜索限制成递归界；没有声称它是运行时间界或多项式界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"495bb24d4506a7c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function","status":"resolved","id":"fffc9733e4a34483","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1","status":"resolved","id":"75a1feabdeb282fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"1\\leq k\\leq n","display":false},{"tex":"a_1,\\ldots,a_k\\in K_{11}","display":false},{"tex":"a_i\\leq n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_{13}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_E:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecFn}_E^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi_E(m)&\\coloneqq13^{m^2+m+1}\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(a_1,\\ldots,a_k)&\\leq\\pi_E(n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecFn}_E^1(\\pi_E)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1878,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 recursive 定义和有限搜索界：[[92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations]] → [[92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness]]。证明码检查递归不意味着定理码成员关系可判定。"},{"id":"ba289179148c44b3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-sequence-bound]]"}],"outgoing":["495bb24d4506a7c2","fffc9733e4a34483","75a1feabdeb282fb"]}